'''Winged Pigge''' (天使ブッタ, ''Tenshi Butta'', '''Angel Butta''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Pigge]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]].

