==Trivia==
*Winged Pigge's name and appearance may reference the phrase "when pigs fly", although her wings could never realistically allow her to take flight.
*Winged Pigge's Japanese name (天使ブッタ ''Tenshi Butta'', "Angel Butta") may be a pun on 豚 ''buta'' (pig) and ブッダ ''Budda'' (Buddha).
*According to her Japanese description, it's possible that the effects of Winged Pigge's attack are not caused by Winged Pigge herself, but a [[wikipedia:Homing (biology)|homing]] instinct to return to Heaven (referencing the idea that human souls originate from and seek to return there), and the sight of Winged Pigge's bouncing happens to activate this instinct.
*She originally had a minimum range of 0 rather than -340. This was changed at an unknown date.

